&lt;a href="#screenshots" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src="https://omnagdaa.github.io/docs/projects/dumpscope/start.png"
alt="DumpScope wizard UI"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Case setup wizard&lt;/p&gt;
