&lt;h2&gt;Architecture Notes&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="architecture-notes"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#architecture-notes" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Threading lock serializes Volatility3 subprocess calls and handles corrupted symbol caches. The QThread worker + signal-based communication pattern built here got reused across later tools.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Memory Forensics</title><link>https://omnagdaa.github.io/docs/memory-forensics/</link><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 03:37:00 +0530</pubDate><guid>https://omnagdaa.github.io/docs/memory-forensics/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Mobile Security</title><link>https://omnagdaa.github.io/docs/mobile-security/</link><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 03:37:00 +0530</pubDate><guid>https://omnagdaa.github.io/docs/mobile-security/</guid><description/></item></channel></rss>